WEBVTT

01:24.960 --> 01:27.120
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:40.200 --> 01:42.720
Lady Huan, we have a guest
from Zhenlang Pavilion.

01:44.680 --> 01:46.560
What do you want to see me about?

01:46.640 --> 01:49.400
My master wants to pay you 30 million mace

01:50.200 --> 01:52.120
to withdraw from the Qionghua Festival.

01:52.920 --> 01:54.440
You'd better take it.

02:04.560 --> 02:06.280
Thirty million mace

02:06.880 --> 02:09.320
is enough for you to live well

02:09.840 --> 02:11.840
for the rest of your life.

02:12.440 --> 02:14.520
What's good about being a top beauty?

02:17.040 --> 02:17.880
Ms. Huan.

02:19.360 --> 02:21.080
You're reasonable.

02:21.760 --> 02:24.840
You're old. It would be nice to retire.

02:24.920 --> 02:26.760
You're old and wrinkled.

02:27.920 --> 02:29.280
If you agree,

02:29.360 --> 02:33.480
I'll deliver the money tomorrow.

02:33.560 --> 02:34.960
-Lady Huan…
-Well.

02:35.040 --> 02:36.920
Thirty million mace.

02:37.760 --> 02:40.000
It turns out I mean so much to you.

02:41.800 --> 02:44.080
Thank Master Yan for me.

02:44.920 --> 02:45.880
Tell him

02:47.560 --> 02:48.640
I don't need it.

02:50.960 --> 02:52.000
You have a personality.

02:55.280 --> 02:56.880
Sir.

02:58.000 --> 02:59.120
Lady Huan.

03:02.120 --> 03:04.440
Lady Huan refused.

03:05.400 --> 03:07.920
She gave up 30 million

03:08.440 --> 03:09.560
to work with Duanwu.

03:15.960 --> 03:17.360
Forget it.

03:19.360 --> 03:20.320
What about the Zheng family?

03:20.400 --> 03:22.680
Zheng Shiyuan is sophisticated.

03:23.280 --> 03:24.760
I didn't find anything on him.

03:24.840 --> 03:26.280
But Zheng Si

03:26.360 --> 03:28.440
accepts bribes.

03:29.120 --> 03:31.240
He seems to have reaped some profit.

03:31.320 --> 03:33.480
Look for evidence.

03:33.560 --> 03:34.480
Okay.

03:35.440 --> 03:37.600
YANGZHOU JEWELRY GUILD

03:37.680 --> 03:38.640
Have you heard

03:39.240 --> 03:42.200
that there are new rules
for the Qionghua Festival?

03:43.000 --> 03:45.040
The songstress who sells the most
is the top beauty.

03:45.120 --> 03:47.280
It's a competition for our money.

03:48.960 --> 03:51.080
Mr. Xu is brilliant.

03:51.880 --> 03:54.240
By the way,
which songstress did you vote for?

03:54.320 --> 03:56.320
My strength is limited.

03:57.080 --> 03:59.480
I followed Mr. Qin's lead.

04:01.800 --> 04:05.080
Mr. Qin must have voted for Lady Bai.

04:05.720 --> 04:07.520
Lady Bai won twice in a row.

04:07.600 --> 04:08.720
She has a good chance of winning.

04:09.960 --> 04:11.040
Thank you.

04:11.560 --> 04:13.000
Who did you vote for?

04:13.080 --> 04:15.760
I followed Mr. Zheng
and voted for Xue Liniang.

04:15.840 --> 04:17.399
Her dancing

04:17.480 --> 04:19.120
is the best.

04:22.960 --> 04:24.600
Master Yan,
you just took over Zhenlang Pavilion.

04:24.680 --> 04:26.480
You need to make a name of yourself.

04:26.560 --> 04:27.720
Master Yan, who did you vote for?

04:27.800 --> 04:29.640
Lady Huan is good
at both singing and dancing.

04:29.720 --> 04:30.840
I voted for Bai Niao.

04:30.920 --> 04:32.760
Zhenlang Pavilion also voted for Lady Bai.

04:35.120 --> 04:38.160
Mr. Qin, good for you.

04:38.760 --> 04:40.560
Thank you.

04:42.400 --> 04:45.040
Mr. Huan, I'm sorry.

04:45.120 --> 04:48.360
Looks like I'll take Zhenlang Pavilion

04:48.440 --> 04:49.440
and your Tongbao House's business.

04:50.120 --> 04:51.560
Thank you.

04:55.480 --> 04:56.400
Mr. Huan.

04:56.920 --> 04:58.080
No offense.

04:58.680 --> 05:00.240
Lady Huan is distant.

05:00.320 --> 05:02.280
She gives people attitude,

05:02.360 --> 05:03.320
and she's arrogant.

05:03.400 --> 05:06.960
We go to her to have fun,
not to get angry.

05:08.240 --> 05:09.520
Huan…

05:10.360 --> 05:11.200
Directors.

05:12.040 --> 05:13.600
Mr. Zheng.

05:17.320 --> 05:18.200
Sit down.

05:20.720 --> 05:22.440
You must have heard of it.

05:22.520 --> 05:23.880
I'll say no more.

05:24.480 --> 05:27.600
Mr. Xu takes
the Qionghua Festival seriously.

05:27.680 --> 05:29.120
He will attend in person.

05:29.200 --> 05:32.080
Please support the Qionghua Festival.

05:32.160 --> 05:33.440
If the Qionghua Festival goes well,

05:33.520 --> 05:35.880
our Yangzhou Jewelry Guild will look good.

05:41.000 --> 05:43.040
Master Yan, you're a promising young man.

05:43.120 --> 05:44.240
You took over the Cui family's property.

05:44.320 --> 05:46.200
You're great.

05:46.280 --> 05:47.400
I'm flattered.

05:48.040 --> 05:50.280
That was just my luck.

05:51.720 --> 05:53.200
Mr. Zheng.

05:53.280 --> 05:54.920
You took over the position
of the guild lead.

05:55.680 --> 05:59.280
You're sophisticated.

06:04.080 --> 06:05.600
He has a sharp tongue.

06:05.680 --> 06:08.040
He didn't want to lose to me in words.

06:09.120 --> 06:11.560
You might as well call me cunning.

06:11.640 --> 06:13.320
You joined Yangzhou Jewelry Guild.

06:13.400 --> 06:15.280
We're in the same boat.

06:16.000 --> 06:17.480
Don't capsize the boat.

06:18.880 --> 06:19.720
I won't.

06:23.640 --> 06:25.240
Directors, cheers.

06:26.760 --> 06:27.720
Cheers.

06:34.720 --> 06:37.200
Lady Huan,
you're thinking about the jewelry now.

06:37.280 --> 06:39.400
Zhenlang Pavilion gave you
30 million mace yesterday.

06:39.480 --> 06:40.760
Why didn't you accept it?

06:44.360 --> 06:46.000
Zhenlang Pavilion gave you
30 million mace yesterday?

06:48.840 --> 06:50.000
Lady Huan.

06:50.520 --> 06:51.640
What happened?

06:51.720 --> 06:52.800
It's all your fault.

06:52.880 --> 06:54.520
Lady Huan didn't want to participate
in the Qionghua Festival.

06:54.600 --> 06:55.600
Shut up, Levi.

06:55.680 --> 06:56.720
Why did you

06:57.320 --> 07:00.400
give all my jewelry to Mr. Huan
without my consent?

07:00.480 --> 07:02.480
Mr. Huan is a Huan.

07:02.560 --> 07:05.280
All your jewelry is from Mr. Huan.

07:05.360 --> 07:07.120
The Huan family
wanted to remake jewelry for you.

07:07.200 --> 07:08.040
I had to give it to them.

07:08.120 --> 07:09.480
The Huan family?

07:10.520 --> 07:12.720
Well, when I was five,

07:12.800 --> 07:15.400
I entered the Huan family to practice
the pipa. I haven't had a day off.

07:15.480 --> 07:18.000
When I was nine,
I played the pipa on stage

07:18.640 --> 07:21.040
and made the Huan family famous again
in Yangzhou.

07:21.720 --> 07:24.280
When I was 12, they sent me to a brothel.

07:24.360 --> 07:27.320
I put on makeup
and received guests for the Huan family.

07:27.400 --> 07:29.320
Only I gradually degenerated.

07:29.400 --> 07:31.640
No one asked me if I wanted to do it.

07:31.720 --> 07:34.000
Do you really think I'm a Huan?

07:35.440 --> 07:36.280
Lady Huan, I was wrong.

07:36.360 --> 07:38.560
I didn't think that much.
I won't do it again.

07:38.640 --> 07:40.200
That being the case,

07:42.240 --> 07:44.040
you decide if you want to stay or go.

07:48.920 --> 07:50.680
Lady Huan, take care.

07:57.400 --> 07:59.360
Lady Huan, are you going to let her go?

08:00.640 --> 08:01.880
She wanted to go.

08:03.320 --> 08:04.640
Levi.

08:05.480 --> 08:06.800
Levi.

08:07.720 --> 08:09.280
It's a bad name.

08:09.960 --> 08:12.320
It sounds like "leave".

08:19.960 --> 08:21.520
Lady Huan, look at you.

08:22.800 --> 08:24.360
Obviously, you don't want her to go.

08:25.960 --> 08:27.360
Since you didn't want her to go,

08:28.440 --> 08:29.760
why did you do that?

08:29.840 --> 08:33.480
If I force her to stay, we'll suffer.

08:34.480 --> 08:36.480
Why do people have to suffer?

08:37.080 --> 08:39.600
They never treated me like family.

08:39.679 --> 08:42.039
Now, I treat them the same way.

08:43.240 --> 08:44.480
If the jewelry

08:44.560 --> 08:46.560
can buy me a clean break
with the Huan family,

08:47.640 --> 08:48.720
I think it's worth it.

09:04.160 --> 09:05.160
Miss. Su,

09:05.720 --> 09:08.480
the Qionghua Festival
is more than just talent.

09:09.360 --> 09:10.520
The backers' strength,

09:10.600 --> 09:13.120
clothes, jewelry, makeup, and music.

09:13.760 --> 09:15.720
Everything costs a lot.

09:16.320 --> 09:17.400
Now,

09:17.480 --> 09:19.640
I don't even have
a decent piece of jewelry.

09:19.720 --> 09:23.200
It's a pipe dream for me
to join the Qionghua Festival.

09:28.880 --> 09:30.520
We'll figure it out.

09:31.320 --> 09:32.880
Lady Huan, give me some time.

09:34.160 --> 09:35.000
Let me ask you something.

09:36.800 --> 09:39.720
Am I the only songstress
you can find right now?

09:47.080 --> 09:47.960
Forget it.

09:49.040 --> 09:50.720
We are at the end of our rope.

09:56.240 --> 09:57.600
There's another way.

09:59.720 --> 10:01.320
Maybe I can give it a try.

10:06.120 --> 10:07.160
Si.

10:07.880 --> 10:09.560
Stop beating him.

10:09.640 --> 10:12.160
He'll die. I'm begging you.

10:12.240 --> 10:14.040
Stop beating him.

10:14.120 --> 10:15.440
Help.

10:15.520 --> 10:16.720
Stop!

10:17.480 --> 10:20.240
Si. The Cui family has been ruined.

10:20.320 --> 10:22.240
He's my only son.

10:22.320 --> 10:25.840
If you kill him, you're killing me.

10:32.560 --> 10:34.000
Here's the evidence.

10:34.080 --> 10:35.120
ZHENG SI EMBEZZLED THE FAMILY'S MONEY
TO PROVIDE FOR A SONGSTRESS

10:35.200 --> 10:36.920
Look what your son did.

10:37.520 --> 10:38.880
He stole money from the family

10:38.960 --> 10:40.720
and helped a washed-up songstress

10:40.800 --> 10:42.480
to be the top beauty.

10:43.320 --> 10:44.440
It must be them.

10:45.000 --> 10:47.640
They must have framed my son.

10:47.720 --> 10:50.080
I'm your wife.

10:50.160 --> 10:52.440
You can't favor your concubine.

10:53.040 --> 10:56.240
Master, the lady misunderstood me.

10:56.320 --> 10:59.280
Please forgive Si.

10:59.360 --> 11:00.440
Please let him go.

11:00.520 --> 11:02.080
Stop it.

11:03.840 --> 11:05.800
I will beat

11:07.080 --> 11:08.920
those who intercede with him.

11:09.640 --> 11:12.280
-Stop hanging out with that songstress.
-Father.

11:12.360 --> 11:13.960
-Father.
-Master.

11:14.920 --> 11:16.040
Master!

11:16.560 --> 11:18.280
-You'll kill him.
-Father.

11:18.360 --> 11:19.680
Stop beating him.

11:20.200 --> 11:21.040
Master.

11:21.640 --> 11:23.440
-Stop beating him.
-Mom!

11:23.520 --> 11:24.640
Help!

11:30.120 --> 11:31.400
-Si…
-Father.

11:36.480 --> 11:38.560
No wonder you bragged to me.

11:38.640 --> 11:40.280
Shiqi's craft is great.

11:40.920 --> 11:43.360
Even the craftsmen
from Zhenlang Pavilion and Jubao House

11:43.440 --> 11:45.120
can't compare to her.

11:45.200 --> 11:47.520
Shiqi, thank Lady Huan.

11:48.280 --> 11:49.520
Thank you, Lady Huan.

11:56.000 --> 11:57.240
Lady Huan.

11:57.320 --> 11:58.920
Check this out.

12:00.040 --> 12:01.680
We've drawn the jewelry

12:01.760 --> 12:02.880
for the Qionghua Festival.

12:03.480 --> 12:04.640
Do you like it?

12:04.720 --> 12:06.600
If you don't like it, I'll modify it.

12:08.680 --> 12:10.240
JEWELRY DRAWING

12:10.320 --> 12:11.920
It's silver jewelry.

12:12.520 --> 12:13.760
It's beautiful.

12:14.360 --> 12:16.080
But is it too plain?

12:16.160 --> 12:19.720
The Qionghua Festival
will be full of flowers

12:19.800 --> 12:20.880
and magnificent jewelry.

12:21.720 --> 12:24.560
It would stand out

12:24.640 --> 12:26.120
if we made it simple.

12:26.200 --> 12:27.040
What do you think?

12:28.840 --> 12:30.240
You have a point. I agree.

12:34.200 --> 12:36.040
Who is Lady Huan?

12:36.120 --> 12:37.000
I am.

12:37.880 --> 12:38.880
Here's your letter.

12:41.640 --> 12:42.520
It's…

12:51.640 --> 12:52.600
Yunxiu.

12:53.240 --> 12:54.960
Don't make the shells too thin.

12:57.640 --> 12:58.680
Breakup letter.

13:06.560 --> 13:07.400
Lady Huan.

13:08.600 --> 13:10.400
-At the Qionghua Festival…
-Su Muzhe.

13:11.880 --> 13:15.240
I'll quit the Qionghua Festival.

13:17.920 --> 13:18.840
Please leave.

13:18.920 --> 13:21.480
Lady Huan, what happened?

13:22.520 --> 13:24.120
Who wrote you that letter?

13:24.200 --> 13:25.600
Is it your lover?

13:26.760 --> 13:27.680
Don't ask.

13:27.760 --> 13:29.120
-Su Muzhe, please leave.
-Lady Huan.

13:30.440 --> 13:32.120
Who is your lover?

13:32.200 --> 13:33.960
Can I talk to him?

13:34.040 --> 13:35.720
Don't rush into anything.

13:35.800 --> 13:37.440
Maybe it's not what you think.

13:38.040 --> 13:39.200
Stop it.

13:40.240 --> 13:42.520
-Lady Huan.
-He doesn't love me anymore.

13:45.640 --> 13:47.280
I've been with him for years.

13:48.640 --> 13:50.080
I've done so much for him.

13:55.120 --> 13:57.480
Now, he abandoned me.

13:58.600 --> 13:59.600
It's been my unrequited love

14:00.120 --> 14:02.480
all these years.

14:03.400 --> 14:06.000
He never really wanted to be with me.

14:06.080 --> 14:09.320
He didn't want anyone
to know about our relationship.

14:11.280 --> 14:12.400
You always say

14:13.320 --> 14:16.040
I have to be the top beauty.

14:16.120 --> 14:18.080
Because when I become the top beauty,

14:18.160 --> 14:20.200
he may think more of me.

14:20.880 --> 14:24.040
Now, no one wants me anymore.

14:25.000 --> 14:25.880
Muzhe.

14:27.800 --> 14:30.200
You've drawn so many good drawings.

14:31.640 --> 14:34.080
Shiqi has great craft.

14:34.760 --> 14:37.800
What's the use of you
having such a good craft?

14:37.880 --> 14:40.760
It's useless.

14:40.840 --> 14:42.560
What we need most now is money.

14:43.280 --> 14:47.320
I can't be the top beauty on our own.

14:48.160 --> 14:50.440
Leave me alone.

14:50.520 --> 14:51.560
Please leave.

14:54.840 --> 14:56.760
Leave me alone.

15:10.920 --> 15:11.800
Lady Huan.

15:15.040 --> 15:16.400
I won't leave you alone.

15:18.240 --> 15:21.400
Please leave. Leave me alone.

15:21.480 --> 15:23.160
Leave me alone!

15:25.400 --> 15:27.320
Please leave!

15:28.240 --> 15:30.240
Leave!

15:37.240 --> 15:38.920
Leave.

15:40.240 --> 15:42.200
Leave.

15:52.560 --> 15:54.520
After your letter
was sent to the Zheng family,

15:54.600 --> 15:56.760
Zheng Si was beaten severely.

15:56.840 --> 15:58.360
He was deprived of stewardship

15:58.440 --> 16:01.880
and grounded.

16:01.960 --> 16:03.760
Zheng Si's strength was weakened.

16:04.280 --> 16:05.560
Zheng Wu will take action.

16:06.240 --> 16:07.800
They started a fight.

16:08.320 --> 16:09.960
It won't end until one of them dies.

16:11.720 --> 16:13.600
As long as I'm in Yangzhou,

16:14.320 --> 16:15.920
I won't give the Zheng family

16:16.440 --> 16:17.880
a break.

16:17.960 --> 16:23.480
BAICAOJING HOUSE

16:47.360 --> 16:50.120
Duanwu, eat it. It's going to get cold.

16:51.400 --> 16:54.440
-Lady Bai.
-Lady Bai.

16:54.520 --> 16:56.000
-Lady Bai is beautiful.
-Excuse me.

16:56.080 --> 16:59.800
-Lady Bai.
-Duanwu, it's Master Yan and Lady Bai.

16:59.880 --> 17:02.200
-Lady Bai.
-Lady Bai.

17:02.720 --> 17:04.280
She's beautiful.

17:04.800 --> 17:06.839
-Lady Bai.
-Lady Bai.

17:08.760 --> 17:10.160
She's beautiful.

17:10.240 --> 17:11.920
She's beautiful. She's beautiful.

17:12.000 --> 17:13.000
It's so beautiful.

17:13.079 --> 17:15.440
She's like a fairy.

17:21.240 --> 17:22.920
Lady Bai, you're so beautiful.

17:24.480 --> 17:27.280
-Lady Bai.
-Lady Bai.

17:27.359 --> 17:29.520
-Shame on him.
-Excuse me.

17:30.840 --> 17:31.920
Lady Bai.

17:32.000 --> 17:34.240
-Lady Bai, you're beautiful.
-Yeah.

17:44.440 --> 17:46.600
It can't be any cheaper.

18:09.440 --> 18:11.680
Why’s the horse going so fast?
Watch out for us!

18:11.760 --> 18:13.320
It's so fast.

18:31.360 --> 18:32.840
JIANGYANG TOWER

18:35.840 --> 18:37.720
Interesting, Su Muzhe.

18:38.320 --> 18:40.680
You risked your life to stop me.

18:45.800 --> 18:47.880
Mr. Zheng, I have a favor to ask you.

18:48.880 --> 18:50.360
-Mr. Zheng…
-What?

18:50.880 --> 18:52.880
Don't you want to surprise me

18:52.960 --> 18:54.480
at the Qionghua Festival?

19:01.320 --> 19:03.560
You have to show your sincerity.

19:04.200 --> 19:05.040
How about this?

19:06.400 --> 19:07.240
Get down on your knees.

19:41.160 --> 19:42.840
Mr. Zheng, please do me a favor.

20:08.880 --> 20:09.760
What do you

20:10.680 --> 20:11.840
want me to do?

20:18.440 --> 20:20.000
Mr. Zheng, you must have heard

20:20.080 --> 20:22.280
that Yan Zijing
wanted to make Bai Niao the top beauty.

20:23.040 --> 20:24.080
I…

20:25.600 --> 20:26.560
want to help Lady Huan,

20:27.560 --> 20:28.840
but Yan Zijing

20:29.400 --> 20:30.840
burned Lady Huan's bridges.

20:31.560 --> 20:32.800
We hit a dead end.

20:33.920 --> 20:35.200
We need your help.

20:35.280 --> 20:36.440
Everyone knows

20:36.960 --> 20:38.920
that my Zheng family
wants to make Xue Liniang the top beauty.

20:40.240 --> 20:43.720
Why should I rebel against my family
to help you?

20:44.440 --> 20:45.400
First,

20:46.720 --> 20:48.200
if Bai Niao becomes the top beauty,

20:49.000 --> 20:50.920
Zhenlang Pavilion will rise.

20:51.760 --> 20:54.080
It'll be a threat to the Zheng family.

20:54.720 --> 20:56.840
It's bad for you, me,

20:57.360 --> 20:58.320
and the Zheng Family.

21:00.000 --> 21:01.000
Second,

21:01.080 --> 21:02.800
you are not the heir

21:05.400 --> 21:07.040
of the Zheng family.

21:08.600 --> 21:10.120
How can you guarantee

21:10.200 --> 21:12.400
that the Zheng family
has a place for you in the future?

21:13.520 --> 21:15.120
It's good for you

21:17.680 --> 21:18.680
to plan ahead.

21:22.400 --> 21:24.360
If you agree,

21:25.560 --> 21:29.080
I'll help you run your business

21:29.160 --> 21:30.080
in return.

21:41.280 --> 21:42.680
Please help me.

21:59.360 --> 22:00.400
I…

22:02.280 --> 22:03.200
disagree.

22:16.880 --> 22:21.680
Smart people only do what's good for them.

22:31.480 --> 22:33.160
The tea is too hot.

22:38.560 --> 22:39.400
Remember.

22:40.120 --> 22:42.280
Be obedient in the future.

22:47.880 --> 22:48.920
Thank you, Mr. Zheng.

23:01.080 --> 23:03.040
Aren't you worried about Duanwu?

23:04.720 --> 23:06.280
I'm worried about her.

23:08.760 --> 23:10.160
But I believe her.

23:11.040 --> 23:13.520
Lady Huan,
you also believe her, don't you?

23:14.200 --> 23:15.360
Muzhe said

23:16.040 --> 23:17.720
that you must learn
to love yourself first.

23:18.520 --> 23:20.000
She went everywhere for me

23:20.520 --> 23:22.880
and tried to pull me out of the abyss.

23:23.440 --> 23:24.800
I believe her.

23:24.880 --> 23:26.760
Duanwu said the same thing to me.

23:26.840 --> 23:29.880
You should rely on yourself
rather than others.

23:30.760 --> 23:31.800
Good one.

23:32.800 --> 23:35.080
When you came,

23:35.680 --> 23:36.960
it was as if spring had come.

23:38.080 --> 23:39.080
That's great.

23:39.160 --> 23:41.800
Lady Huan. Shiqi.

23:42.760 --> 23:44.080
-Duanwu.
-Muzhe.

23:46.200 --> 23:47.040
How's it going?

23:48.640 --> 23:50.600
Did you find someone to support me?

23:50.680 --> 23:51.760
I did it.

23:54.800 --> 23:56.240
That's a lot of money.

23:56.320 --> 23:57.840
Does he have any harsh conditions?

23:58.440 --> 23:59.600
Lady Huan, don't worry.

24:00.120 --> 24:01.040
Put it away.

24:02.720 --> 24:03.560
It's the Zheng family.

24:04.240 --> 24:05.160
Zheng family?

24:07.800 --> 24:08.720
Zheng Wu.

24:10.880 --> 24:11.960
Zheng Wu.

24:13.560 --> 24:14.680
He's a concubine's son.

24:14.760 --> 24:16.160
How could he come up with so much money?

24:16.240 --> 24:17.960
It's because he's a concubine's son

24:18.920 --> 24:21.400
that I made a deal with him.

24:24.480 --> 24:25.720
Lady Huan, don't worry.

24:25.800 --> 24:27.560
Zheng Wu only provides money.

24:28.280 --> 24:29.400
It has nothing to do with you.

24:31.640 --> 24:34.040
-All right.
-Great.

24:34.120 --> 24:37.520
Duanwu, with all this gold,
we can buy the best jade jewelry.

24:38.440 --> 24:40.240
Lady Huan, don't worry.

24:40.320 --> 24:41.160
I'm sure we'll win.

24:45.560 --> 24:46.400
We'll win.

24:49.920 --> 24:50.840
Yunxiu.

24:52.080 --> 24:53.600
We now have this gold.

24:53.680 --> 24:55.680
I'll draw more drawings.

24:55.760 --> 24:57.200
Lady Huan, you can pick from them then.

24:58.160 --> 24:59.000
New drawings.

24:59.640 --> 25:00.760
Can we make it?

25:00.840 --> 25:02.160
We have to do it.

25:03.440 --> 25:04.480
I'll stay up all night drawing.

25:05.400 --> 25:07.360
Lady Huan, did you see

25:07.440 --> 25:09.440
other songstresses' jewelry?

25:10.640 --> 25:13.360
Do I have the same drawing as theirs?

25:13.440 --> 25:15.360
Or am I not as good as them?

25:21.080 --> 25:22.320
Are you worried about losing?

25:24.000 --> 25:25.640
You told me

25:26.160 --> 25:27.440
that jewelry has spirit.

25:28.040 --> 25:30.280
If you are not calm when making jewelry,

25:30.360 --> 25:32.160
the jewelry won't be outstanding.

25:37.000 --> 25:38.160
Up to this point,

25:41.880 --> 25:43.240
I'm kind of scared.

25:45.600 --> 25:46.560
Lady Huan.

25:49.040 --> 25:50.440
What if you lose the top beauty

25:52.520 --> 25:53.960
because I didn't

25:55.840 --> 25:56.960
do my jewelry well?

25:58.840 --> 26:01.320
Your Clear Mind is a new shop.

26:01.400 --> 26:03.840
Other jewelry shops have been open
in Yangzhou for many years.

26:04.440 --> 26:05.560
It's not easy for you

26:05.640 --> 26:07.400
to amaze the people.

26:08.320 --> 26:12.520
Not to mention, we don't have anything.

26:13.160 --> 26:14.560
Don't be afraid to lose.

26:23.320 --> 26:24.640
Lady Huan, you're right.

26:25.320 --> 26:26.160
Muzhe.

26:28.240 --> 26:29.600
Close your ears.

26:29.680 --> 26:30.960
Clear your mind.

26:33.360 --> 26:35.040
It's time to fight.

26:35.120 --> 26:36.200
We don't fight for others.

26:36.760 --> 26:37.840
We fight for ourselves.

26:42.200 --> 26:43.240
Yes.

27:16.040 --> 27:17.080
Stop.

27:23.920 --> 27:25.000
You've been practicing all morning,

27:25.080 --> 27:26.400
but you're not getting any better.

27:34.200 --> 27:35.800
Dancing is not about showing off.

27:36.320 --> 27:39.040
It's about understanding its essence.

27:39.560 --> 27:41.760
Breathing, rhythm,

27:42.280 --> 27:44.840
action, and emotion.

27:45.560 --> 27:47.400
You must think over

27:47.960 --> 27:50.360
every detail.

27:52.000 --> 27:52.960
If you can make a difference

27:53.560 --> 27:55.560
in the same dance,

27:57.640 --> 27:59.320
you are qualified to be the top beauty.

28:00.240 --> 28:01.520
Are you tired?

28:02.800 --> 28:03.840
No.

28:04.360 --> 28:05.200
Are you sure?

28:06.720 --> 28:07.800
Yes.

28:08.600 --> 28:09.440
Good.

28:10.400 --> 28:12.040
If you're tired,
quit the Qionghua Festival.

28:54.760 --> 28:56.320
Lady Bai, don't worry.

28:56.400 --> 28:59.440
These press-on nails are the same
as the ones you gave me.

29:00.560 --> 29:01.640
Reward him.

29:04.440 --> 29:05.600
Thank you, Lady Bai.

29:05.680 --> 29:06.680
Excuse me.

29:08.440 --> 29:11.640
Niao.

29:15.240 --> 29:17.280
Look. The Zheng family
sent you an invitation.

29:17.360 --> 29:18.840
They have an honored guest
for dinner tonight.

29:18.920 --> 29:19.880
They invited you to accompany them.

29:21.920 --> 29:24.000
Why didn't they ask Xue Liniang to go?

29:25.160 --> 29:26.920
Xue Liniang practices every day.

29:27.520 --> 29:29.040
But they always ask me to accompany them.

29:29.120 --> 29:31.400
Xue Liniang can't compare to you.

29:31.480 --> 29:33.080
You're the top beauty.

29:33.680 --> 29:34.760
Besides,

29:34.840 --> 29:36.720
we can't offend Mr. Zheng.

29:41.400 --> 29:42.600
Guys, check this out.

29:42.680 --> 29:44.560
Lady Bai passed the age
of flower blooming.

29:44.640 --> 29:46.120
But she said she was only
the age of peach and plum.

29:49.160 --> 29:51.080
Lady Bai is not 20 years old.

29:51.800 --> 29:54.120
-She's 24.
-Yeah.

29:54.200 --> 29:57.680
Songstress Yan said
she was from a famous family,

29:57.760 --> 29:59.240
but she's from a poor family.

29:59.320 --> 30:00.480
She pawns her jewelry for a living.

30:00.560 --> 30:02.400
She's beautiful on the outside
but mean on the inside.

30:02.480 --> 30:03.960
It's mean.

30:04.840 --> 30:05.880
Look at this.

30:06.680 --> 30:08.080
Songstress Yingtao

30:08.160 --> 30:10.120
eats three baked flatbreads at a meal.

30:13.400 --> 30:15.160
Even I can't eat that much.

30:16.160 --> 30:17.560
Songstress Xue Liniang

30:17.640 --> 30:19.280
spends all her salary every month.

30:19.360 --> 30:20.800
She has almost no savings.

30:20.880 --> 30:23.560
She spent all her money on cosmetics,
jewelry, and clothes.

30:24.320 --> 30:27.400
She loves beauty.

30:27.480 --> 30:28.320
Look at this.

30:28.400 --> 30:29.960
Lady Huan

30:30.040 --> 30:31.240
is the adopted daughter
of the Huan family.

30:31.320 --> 30:34.840
The Huan family made her a songstress

30:34.920 --> 30:37.000
and used her as a cash cow.

30:37.720 --> 30:40.280
Look at Songstress Cao
and Songstress Wang.

30:40.360 --> 30:42.440
All the famous songstresses in Yangzhou

30:42.520 --> 30:44.280
are scolded.

30:44.360 --> 30:45.840
Who did this?

30:56.680 --> 30:58.120
Mr. Xu, please.

30:58.200 --> 30:59.560
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

31:06.400 --> 31:09.080
Mr. Xu, it's an honor to have you

31:09.160 --> 31:10.880
at the Qionghua Festival.

31:12.680 --> 31:13.600
Mr. Xu.

31:13.680 --> 31:18.840
I invited a top beauty to entertain us.

31:18.920 --> 31:20.880
You didn't have to do this.

31:21.400 --> 31:24.720
The Qionghua Festival
is Yangzhou's annual event.

31:24.800 --> 31:26.000
Starting this year,

31:26.080 --> 31:29.280
I will rejoice with the people every year.

31:29.880 --> 31:30.920
Yeah.

31:31.000 --> 31:32.480
Rejoice with the people.

31:32.560 --> 31:34.680
Mr. Xu, please.

31:34.760 --> 31:36.080
How about drinking it up?

31:36.160 --> 31:37.360
Okay. Cheers.

31:45.320 --> 31:47.440
Come on. Fill Mr. Xu's cup.

32:03.520 --> 32:05.160
What is this all about?

32:05.240 --> 32:06.280
Who wrote it?

32:07.160 --> 32:08.920
It's mean.

32:12.400 --> 32:13.400
You're all here.

32:14.000 --> 32:15.080
What happened?

32:15.160 --> 32:16.680
Come on. Check this out.

32:17.200 --> 32:20.240
Lady Bai, you are the top beauty.

32:20.320 --> 32:21.840
This thing happened.

32:21.920 --> 32:23.920
You must step up

32:24.000 --> 32:25.240
and find out who did it.

32:27.560 --> 32:30.040
Yan, you're a talented girl.

32:30.120 --> 32:32.720
How do you have time to read this?

32:32.800 --> 32:36.920
Why don't you spend your time
with poets and artists?

32:37.440 --> 32:39.200
What are you doing here?

32:40.920 --> 32:42.200
We came to you

32:42.280 --> 32:44.080
to figure it out.

32:45.720 --> 32:48.680
I don't know who did it.

32:50.520 --> 32:52.000
If I find out who did it,

32:52.760 --> 32:54.160
I'll rip her face off.

32:55.160 --> 32:56.040
Why are you staring at me?

32:56.920 --> 32:57.760
Are you doubting me?

32:57.840 --> 32:59.360
What's wrong with you?

32:59.880 --> 33:01.120
How could it be me?

33:01.200 --> 33:03.200
You sent people to keep an eye
on the Zheng family.

33:03.800 --> 33:06.800
You pretended to run into them.

33:06.880 --> 33:08.680
But you didn't get Mr. Zheng
to vote for you.

33:08.760 --> 33:11.640
-Did you see that?
-I saw it in person.

33:11.720 --> 33:13.400
Don't talk nonsense.

33:13.480 --> 33:14.760
All right.

33:14.840 --> 33:16.360
We're friends.

33:17.040 --> 33:18.200
Don't doubt each other.

33:18.800 --> 33:21.200
We should prepare
for the Qionghua Festival.

33:21.840 --> 33:23.960
Lady Bai is older.

33:24.040 --> 33:25.840
She's insightful.

33:25.920 --> 33:27.360
Unlike her,

33:27.440 --> 33:30.200
someone only knows making innuendo.

33:30.280 --> 33:31.720
She's ridiculous.

33:31.800 --> 33:32.760
You…

33:32.840 --> 33:33.920
What?

33:37.640 --> 33:40.240
Lady Yan, you're really talented.

33:40.320 --> 33:42.920
You insult people with worded words.
Let me see.

33:43.520 --> 33:45.560
Flower blooming. Peach and plum.

33:45.640 --> 33:47.960
I don't know these words.

33:48.040 --> 33:49.200
-Yeah.
-I dare you to say it again.

33:49.280 --> 33:50.560
Flower blooming. Peach and plum.

33:50.640 --> 33:52.000
I'll tear your throat out.

33:52.080 --> 33:53.240
Come on.

33:53.320 --> 33:55.440
-Tear my throat out.
-Enough.

33:55.520 --> 33:57.320
I need to talk to you.

33:57.400 --> 33:59.080
If you're in trouble,

33:59.680 --> 34:01.800
you can ask us for help.

34:02.440 --> 34:03.840
You didn't have to pawn your stuff

34:03.920 --> 34:05.280
to make yourself look good.

34:05.360 --> 34:06.800
We felt sorry for you

34:06.880 --> 34:08.520
when we found out.

34:14.520 --> 34:16.480
Speaking of that,

34:17.120 --> 34:20.719
the insult to you

34:21.320 --> 34:22.560
was not very harsh.

34:23.159 --> 34:24.639
Why are you coming at me?

34:24.719 --> 34:26.520
I didn't speak ill of you, Lady Bai.

34:27.719 --> 34:28.639
I…

34:30.000 --> 34:31.600
I have the support of the Zheng family.

34:31.679 --> 34:33.120
Why would I do that?

34:33.199 --> 34:34.280
It's useless.

34:35.719 --> 34:37.920
Could it be Lady Huan?

34:38.000 --> 34:40.760
She didn't even show up for this.

34:40.840 --> 34:43.360
She's always been like that.

34:43.440 --> 34:45.120
She's arrogant.

34:48.480 --> 34:50.040
Who knows what will happen

34:50.120 --> 34:51.280
in the current situation?

34:52.159 --> 34:54.239
It's great.

34:57.000 --> 34:58.000
It's so good.

34:58.080 --> 34:59.040
Bravo.

34:59.840 --> 35:01.600
Beautiful body.

35:04.400 --> 35:05.840
Master Yan.

35:08.560 --> 35:12.480
He was a big spender
and a great merchant in Guangzhou.

35:14.040 --> 35:17.200
Why did you come to Yangzhou
to do business?

35:17.800 --> 35:19.760
Long time no see, Mr. Xu.

35:19.840 --> 35:23.280
I didn't expect you to be promoted.

35:23.360 --> 35:25.240
Congratulations.

35:25.320 --> 35:28.520
You knew each other.

35:28.600 --> 35:30.480
Before, Yan was in Guangzhou.

35:30.560 --> 35:31.840
I held a poetry gathering in Guangzhou.

35:31.920 --> 35:34.120
I was honored to have Mr. Xu.

35:34.760 --> 35:37.040
Mr. Xu made a poem.

35:37.120 --> 35:39.120
It's popular in Lingnan.

35:39.720 --> 35:41.480
Mr. Xu, you're talented.

35:41.560 --> 35:42.960
I'm flattered.

35:44.280 --> 35:45.320
Master Yan.

35:46.360 --> 35:48.320
Yangzhou is different from Guangzhou.

35:48.400 --> 35:53.080
You have to operate in accordance
with the law.

35:55.200 --> 35:56.080
I'll keep that in mind.

35:57.440 --> 35:58.880
Mr. Xu, please.

36:03.160 --> 36:04.760
Bravo!

36:06.920 --> 36:08.360
Please.

36:23.320 --> 36:24.720
It's a big occasion.

36:24.800 --> 36:26.840
He brought an unknown woman.

36:27.440 --> 36:28.840
Don't worry.

36:28.920 --> 36:30.520
He did it for fun.

36:30.600 --> 36:32.200
He knows the limitations.

36:39.760 --> 36:41.760
Bravo.

37:00.160 --> 37:01.360
Muzhe.

37:01.920 --> 37:02.840
Which one is better?

37:08.800 --> 37:09.800
Let's try it out.

37:16.560 --> 37:17.920
Is he Yan Zijing?

37:22.480 --> 37:23.560
What kind of a person is he?

37:24.240 --> 37:26.880
He's ruthless and unscrupulous.

37:27.880 --> 37:30.320
He's a vicious man.

37:32.440 --> 37:34.920
I want to know him.

37:36.000 --> 37:36.840
Yingtao.

37:37.440 --> 37:38.640
Where are my dancing shoes?

37:39.320 --> 37:40.720
Coming.

37:43.440 --> 37:44.920
I put your dancing shoes away.

37:45.000 --> 37:45.960
I'll get them for you.

37:47.680 --> 37:48.520
Look.

37:58.880 --> 38:00.440
Lady Xue…

38:00.520 --> 38:03.080
-Didn't I tell you to keep an eye on them?
-This…

38:03.160 --> 38:05.320
All you know is to eat.

38:05.400 --> 38:06.760
-You ruined it.
-What happened?

38:06.840 --> 38:08.280
Ignore them.

38:24.440 --> 38:30.280
-Bravo.
-Bravo.

38:30.800 --> 38:32.440
-Bravo.
-Bravo.

38:32.520 --> 38:33.440
It's Lady Yu.

38:34.080 --> 38:36.440
She was the top beauty
in Yangzhou 20 years ago.

38:36.520 --> 38:39.480
She's really stunning.

38:43.440 --> 38:45.520
You can't wait

38:45.600 --> 38:48.120
to see the beautiful songstresses tonight.

38:48.880 --> 38:50.440
Now, I declare

38:50.520 --> 38:53.680
that the Qionghua Festival
has officially begun.

38:53.760 --> 38:55.640
Great.

38:55.720 --> 38:57.040
Who did it?

38:57.120 --> 38:58.720
Who took my shoes away?

39:03.120 --> 39:05.000
Lady Bai, your dress…

39:05.680 --> 39:07.800
Your dress is broken.

39:07.880 --> 39:09.240
What should we do?

39:12.360 --> 39:13.240
Xue.

39:13.960 --> 39:15.880
My dress was ruined.

39:26.400 --> 39:27.760
I've been here with Duanwu.

39:27.840 --> 39:29.000
We haven't moved.

39:31.400 --> 39:34.400
Can you show us your pipa?

39:34.480 --> 39:35.480
Lady Bai.

39:37.440 --> 39:39.400
The pipa is our secret.

39:39.480 --> 39:40.840
We can't show you.

39:40.920 --> 39:42.000
If you don't show us,

39:42.080 --> 39:43.920
you're the one who did it.

39:44.600 --> 39:46.360
-Yingtao.
-I dare you.

39:47.600 --> 39:49.320
Lady Huan.

39:49.840 --> 39:51.320
I didn't expect you

39:51.400 --> 39:52.760
to be so vicious.

39:52.840 --> 39:55.520
My dancing shoes and Lady Bai's dress
are ruined.

39:56.120 --> 39:57.760
Why are yours intact?

39:57.840 --> 39:59.320
So what?

39:59.400 --> 40:01.600
You didn't take care of your stuff.

40:01.680 --> 40:02.560
What does it have to do with me?

40:02.640 --> 40:03.680
You did it.

40:03.760 --> 40:06.720
You ruined Lady Xue's dancing shoes
and Lady Bai's dress.

40:06.800 --> 40:09.320
-You're vicious.
-Xuanji.

40:09.400 --> 40:10.600
We didn't take good care of them?

40:11.360 --> 40:12.600
I'll see it.

40:22.160 --> 40:25.000
-Xue Liniang, what do you want?
-Huan.

40:25.080 --> 40:26.760
Xue, don't be impulsive.

40:26.840 --> 40:28.640
You have no proof.

40:28.720 --> 40:30.880
We'll talk about it
after the Qionghua Festival.

40:31.960 --> 40:33.720
Don't mess around.

40:35.440 --> 40:36.320
Xuanji.

40:37.320 --> 40:38.560
Don't point fingers.

40:38.640 --> 40:40.400
It's just a dress.

40:40.480 --> 40:41.880
We have spare dresses.

40:41.960 --> 40:43.560
What should I do?

40:43.640 --> 40:45.200
Don't you have spare dresses?

40:48.840 --> 40:49.760
Don't worry.

40:49.840 --> 40:50.760
I have an extra dress.

40:51.480 --> 40:52.360
Xuanji.

40:52.880 --> 40:55.200
Lady Bai, Lady Xue may not fit

40:55.280 --> 40:57.040
into your dress and shoes.

40:57.880 --> 40:59.480
I was negligent.

41:00.680 --> 41:01.760
You…

41:01.840 --> 41:03.360
You ruined our stuff.

41:03.440 --> 41:04.840
Are you not ashamed?

41:04.920 --> 41:05.920
Let's report them.

41:06.000 --> 41:07.040
Xue Liniang.

41:07.720 --> 41:09.240
Lady Huan prepared

41:09.320 --> 41:11.080
a few extra pairs of dancing shoes.

41:11.160 --> 41:12.480
We can lend them to you

41:13.000 --> 41:13.880
if you like.

41:13.960 --> 41:15.200
Yunxiu.

41:18.080 --> 41:19.320
Go get the dancing shoes.

41:30.000 --> 41:32.120
Lady Xue, we have shoes.

41:33.320 --> 41:36.320
Huan, why did you prepare so many shoes?

41:36.400 --> 41:38.400
We did it to watch out for bad people.

41:39.120 --> 41:42.280
There are a lot of bad people
on this occasion.

41:42.360 --> 41:44.480
Just in case.

41:48.600 --> 41:50.800
Thank you, Su.

41:51.400 --> 41:52.640
You're thoughtful.

41:57.280 --> 41:59.240
Lady Bai, we should go get dressed.

41:59.320 --> 42:00.280
Okay.

42:09.480 --> 42:10.520
Don't you like them?

42:15.920 --> 42:16.880
Thank you.

42:23.920 --> 42:25.400
What about our pipa?

42:28.080 --> 42:29.120
Don't worry.
